        "text": "Agreed. Food waste it is. We can find out what happens to unsold food. Were you still thinking of using a questionnaire?",
        "task_id": "76ce78f7-23f8-4993-8e8e-24b62a2c4395",
        "source_sha256": "98d8340269aac528806bdb4702884996ff6c103a1faed3ce8559f7ef53d4e72b"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_3",
        "voice": "James",
        "text": "I was, but the tutor wants us to explore people's reasons, not just count responses. Let's use interviews instead. We can ask follow-up questions when an answer isn't clear.",
        "task_id": "599cc442-5bd1-429d-a58c-f715b9ba178d",
        "source_sha256": "eb612212af70b9eae0a62c4095a4a0ad3a5f76a659f3ecb07f572da0e20c85cb"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_4",
        "voice": "Katie",
        "text": "That makes sense. At first I thought we could talk to customers, but they probably wouldn't know how much gets thrown away.",
        "task_id": "83cc4123-6fe5-4176-bc81-7818457e6c86",
        "source_sha256": "d00133c3b866b16967c40d4c90cce44d3b417dc498dec44140d0891a5269beb5"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_5",
        "voice": "James",
        "text": "Exactly. Shop owners can explain that, so they should be our participants. We can ask how they plan their orders and deal with anything left over.",
        "task_id": "a23c16e1-0cdc-4cfd-8b02-b7ad7d49397e",
        "source_sha256": "a500a733a8cd8168de37928509c0f5213d2d0747e1bd84aabc6caa2e27fe6e7d"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_6",
        "voice": "Katie",
        "text": "How many interviews do we need? I wrote fifteen in our first draft.",
        "task_id": "13d2a3ee-984f-4e45-8991-a3ec41ada7c3",
        "source_sha256": "7159a510b5a94614433916ca4420d9c43c9dce689a7c9ab74f4d326be2338a6a"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_7",
        "voice": "James",
        "text": "The tutor said we must complete at least twelve. Fifteen would be useful, but twelve is the minimum we need to plan for.",
        "task_id": "3f25350a-9833-4709-aa82-7d21d6e0cb63",
        "source_sha256": "cc366cd07db23ac86666b04ff0d223cafa60a5517108e9cd1b76faa5a967f30f"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_8",
        "voice": "Katie",
        "text": "Fine. Let's divide the work evenly. Could we meet on Wednesday to check the interview questions before we contact anyone?",
        "task_id": "22913c51-3591-4b7e-80be-46789fcc934b",
        "source_sha256": "15a722a65018504073e0f931f29401120a6f6d34ec486113c34b37a563264d50"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_9",
        "voice": "James",
        "text": "I have a laboratory session then. Thursday works for me, and it still gives us enough time.",
        "task_id": "d7b19de5-84ef-476c-a283-f86f9968c725",
        "source_sha256": "2390f496d2f10d4839be279340c197ccc8bebf05bb5d4d6b6d556dc0899a8342"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_10",
        "voice": "Katie",
        "text": "Thursday is good. Shall we meet back here in the library?",
        "task_id": "2da6d733-da5c-4b1a-b858-393d83a03115",
        "source_sha256": "807414581b24942117e2eb74f4f91ebe3620201bbe3d4b9985866f17d73b0858"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_11",
        "voice": "James",
        "text": "We need to practise asking the questions aloud, so this quiet area won't work. I've booked Room Four in the study centre. Let's meet there.",
        "task_id": "40f58f9e-1688-400c-b5f2-e58515d81528",
        "source_sha256": "50769d32030563626352f1f39857687e17e7431b9b0860839b7c5aa73898b5ea"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_12",
        "voice": "Katie",
        "text": "Great. I'll bring the draft questions. Before we leave, let's check that none of them tells people what answer we expect.",
        "task_id": "699a4f29-cea2-4078-9902-41730e7ccbbd",
        "source_sha256": "72e01646762cbdf73a3ec473eb585bbc56a30ddbe822a3b8c4f8a2d81c124cc6"
      },
      {
        "id": "L4_13",
        "voice": "James",
        "text": "Good idea. We want to hear their experience, even if it doesn't match what we predicted.",
        "task_id": "38094f92-67b0-4153-868f-68124551e6b1",
        "source_sha256": "d48615c1b82076933a462752c018259ff64f4e71bf7f94594eea7d1a8cb0aa03"
      }
    ],
